0 95 189 [
[(The table contains a transition from 1 to -1 at index 7 to 8 and, which is "smoothed")]
[(as seen in wave-out13. Since index 9 is a copy of 1 there's a transition back. You can)]
[(try below a table without copies for the extra points and see how in this case there's)]
[(not a smooth transition at the wrap around point.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 95 275 [
[(This patch demonstrates 4-point interpolation in [tabread4~]. The 11-point table,)]
[("waveform13", is actually an 8-point table \050from index 1 to 8\051 with extra copied)]
[(points \0500, 9 and 10\051. The 0 index point is a copy of point 8 and points 9 and 10 are)]
[(copies of points 1 and 2, which is needed for the 4-point interpolation \050which means)]
[(the interpolation always happens between 4 consecutive samples of the table\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
